	// GetStock wraps gtk_image_get_stock
	// The function returns the following values:
	// 
	// 	- stockId string: place to store a
	//     stock icon name, or %NULL 
	// 	- size int: place to store a stock icon
	//     size (#GtkIconSize), or %NULL 
	//
